": \"Add calendar integration hints (iCal URLs)\",\n   536→      \"description\": \"Support subscribing to remote iCal feeds. Periodically sync events from external calendars.\",\n   537→      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n   538→        \"Add remote calendar URL\",\n   539→        \"Fetch iCal feed from URL\",\n   540→        \"Merge external events with local events\",\n   541→        \"Refresh interval configurable\",\n   542→        \"Show source for imported events\",\n   543→        \"Handle network errors gracefully\",\n   544→        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n   545→      ],\n   546→      \"priority\": \"P3\",\n   547→      \"dependencies\": [\n   548→        \"US-019\"\n   549→      ],\n   550→      \"passes\": false\n   551→    },\n   552→    {\n   553→      \"id\": \"US-029\",\n   554→      \"title\": \"Implement copy/paste of events\",\n   555→      \"description\": \"Add ability to copy events (yy or visual selection + y) and paste to new dates (p). Support date adjustment on paste.\",\n   556→      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n   557→        \"'yy' copies selected event to clipboard\",\n   558→        \"Visual selection + y copies multiple events\",\n   559→        \"'p' pastes copied events at selected date\",\n   560→        \"Prompt to adjust pasted event times\",\n   561→        \"Paste to different date adjusts event dates\",\n   562→        \"Clipboard persists within session\",\n   563→        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n   564→      ],\n   565→      \"priority\": \"P3\",\n   566→      \"dependencies\": [\n   567→        \"US-026\"\n   568→      ],\n   569→      \"passes\": false\n   570→    },\n   571→    {\n   572→      \"id\": \"US-030\",\n   573→      \"title\": \"Add event templates\",\n   574→      \"description\": \"Create system for event templates (meeting, appointment, task, etc.). Quick-create events from templates with predefined settings.\",\n   575→      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n   576→        \"Template system defined\",\n   577→        \"Pre-built templates included\",\n   578→        \"Template selection in event creation\",\n   579→        \"Templates set duration, category, reminders\",\n   580→        \"Custom templates can be created\",\n   581→        \"Templates saved to config\",\n   582→        \"Quick keys for common templates\",\n   583→        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n   584→      ],\n   585→      \"priority\": \"P3\",\n   586→      \"dependencies\": [\n   587→        \"US-006\"\n   588→      ],\n   589→      \"passes\": false\n   590→    }\n   591→  ],\n   592→  \"metadata\": {\n   593→    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-01-28T23:10:28.458Z\"\n   594→  }\n   595→}\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b1f6debe-4352-4df5-b531-5ba40b818017","uuid":"0d22f98a-6d91-4854-809c-692ef6322c95","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sqibo/devel/clawd/prd.json","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Vim-Optimized Calendar TUI\",\n  \"description\": \"A comprehensive calendar Terminal User Interface application with full calendar features optimized for vim motions. The calendar should support viewing, creating, editing, and deleting events; recurring events; multiple calendar views (day, week, month, year); reminders and notifications; import/export (iCal, CSV); time zone support; search and filtering; color coding by category; keyboard-first navigation with vim-style keybindings for all operations; and a clean, intuitive terminal interface using modern TUI libraries.\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Initialize Rust project structure with ratatui\",\n      \"description\": \"Set up a new Rust project with ratatui, crossterm, and chrono dependencies. Create basic project structure with module organization for calendar, events, views, and UI components.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Cargo.toml includes ratatui, crossterm, chrono, serde dependencies\",\n        \"Project has src/ directory with modular structure\",\n        \"Basic ratatui terminal initialization works\",\n        \"Application runs without crashing\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P0\",\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"passes\": true,\n      \"completionNotes\": \"Completed by agent\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Design core data models for calendar and events\",\n      \"description\": \"Define core data structures including Event (id, title, start_time, end_time, description, location, recurring_rules, category, reminders), CalendarEvent with serialization support, and CalendarState for managing current date, view mode, and event list.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Event struct with all required fields\",\n        \"Serde serialization/deserialization implemented\",\n        \"CalendarState struct for app state management\",\n        \"Unit tests for data model operations\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P0\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-001\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": true,\n      \"completionNotes\": \"Completed by agent\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement in-memory event storage with CRUD operations\",\n      \"description\": \"Create an EventStore trait and in-memory implementation supporting create, read, update, delete, and query operations. Support filtering by date range and category.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"EventStore trait defined with CRUD methods\",\n        \"InMemoryEventStore implementation working\",\n        \"Can create and retrieve events\",\n        \"Can update existing events\",\n        \"Can delete events\",\n        \"Can query events by date range\",\n        \"Unit tests for all operations\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P0\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-002\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": true,\n      \"completionNotes\": \"Completed by agent\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-004\",\n      \"title\": \"Build month calendar view layout\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement a month view showing a 7x6 grid of dates with current date highlighting and event indicators. Display events for selected date in side panel.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Month view displays current month calendar grid\",\n        \"Today's date is highlighted\",\n        \"Days with events show indicator\",\n        \"Selected date shows details in side panel\",\n        \"Navigation to previous/next month works\",\n        \"Cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P0\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-003\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-005\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement vim-style navigation for month view\",\n      \"description\": \"Add vim-style keybindings for month view: h/j/k/l for navigation within dates, g for go to date, G for go to today, w/e for week navigation, b/f for month navigation, / for search.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"h/l moves between days in same week\",\n        \"j/k moves between weeks\",\n        \"w moves to start of week, e to end of week\",\n        \"b/f navigates previous/next month\",\n        \"g prompts for date to jump to\",\n        \"G jumps to today\",\n        \"Navigation feels like vim\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P0\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-004\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-006\",\n      \"title\": \"Create event creation modal with vim editing\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement a modal dialog for creating new events with fields for title, date/time, duration, description, category. Use vim-style editing in text fields.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Modal opens on 'o' key (vim-style for insert)\",\n        \"Title input field with vim-style editing\",\n        \"Date/time picker with keyboard navigation\",\n        \"Duration input\",\n        \"Category selection\",\n        \"Description textarea with vim editing\",\n        \"Save with Ctrl+S or :w\",\n        \"Cancel with Esc or :q\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P0\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-004\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-007\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement event editing and deletion\",\n      \"description\": \"Add ability to edit existing events (e key or Enter on selected event) and delete events (d key or dd for vim-style). Show confirmation before deletion.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Selecting an event and pressing 'e' opens edit modal\",\n        \"Edit modal pre-fills existing event data\",\n        \"Saving updates the event in storage\",\n        \"Pressing 'd' on selected event prompts for confirmation\",\n        \"Confirmed delete removes event from storage\",\n        \"View updates to reflect changes\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P0\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-006\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-008\",\n      \"title\": \"Build week view layout\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement a week view showing 7 days with time-based slots for each day. Display events as blocks in their time slots.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Week view displays 7 days of current week\",\n        \"Each day shows hourly time slots\",\n        \"Events displayed as colored blocks\",\n        \"Current time indicator line\",\n        \"Side panel shows selected day's events\",\n        \"Navigation to previous/next week\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P1\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-003\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-009\",\n      \"title\": \"Build day view layout\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement a detailed day view showing hourly time slots for a single day with events as colored blocks. Show full event details in side panel when selected.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Day view displays hourly slots for selected day\",\n        \"Events shown as colored blocks\",\n        \"Time indicator for current time\",\n        \"Event details panel shows full information\",\n        \"Navigate to previous/next day\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P1\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-003\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-010\",\n      \"title\": \"Build year view layout\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement a year view showing 12 months in a grid format. Allow quick navigation to any month by selecting and entering.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Year view displays 12 months in 4x3 grid\",\n        \"Each month shows summary (number of events)\",\n        \"Selecting a month highlights it\",\n        \"Pressing Enter switches to month view for selected month\",\n        \"Navigate to previous/next year\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P1\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-003\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-011\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement view switching with vim keys\",\n      \"description\": \"Add ability to switch between month, week, day, and year views using keys: 'm' for month, 'w' for week, 'd' for day, 'y' for year. Maintain current date context when switching.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"'m' key switches to month view\",\n        \"'w' key switches to week view\",\n        \"'d' key switches to day view\",\n        \"'y' key switches to year view\",\n        \"Current date preserved when switching views\",\n        \"Visual indicator of current view mode\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P1\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-008\",\n        \"US-009\",\n        \"US-010\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-012\",\n      \"title\": \"Add vim-style text editing to all input fields\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement a vim-like text editor widget for all text inputs (event titles, descriptions, search). Support i, a, A, I for insert modes, Esc for normal mode, basic motion keys, y/p for yank/paste.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Vim mode indicator in input fields\",\n        \"i inserts before cursor, I at start of line\",\n        \"a appends after cursor, A at end of line\",\n        \"Esc returns to normal mode\",\n        \"h/j/k/l for cursor movement\",\n        \"w/b for word navigation\",\n        \"dd deletes current line\",\n        \"yy yanks current line\",\n        \"p pastes yanked text\",\n        \"All text inputs use consistent vim editing\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P1\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-006\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-013\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement event color coding by category\",\n      \"description\": \"Add category system with predefined categories (work, personal, meeting, reminder, etc.). Each category has an associated color for visual distinction in calendar views.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Category enum with predefined values\",\n        \"Color mapping for each category\",\n        \"Events display with their category color\",\n        \"Category selector in event creation/edit\",\n        \"New categories can be added\",\n        \"Color scheme is visually distinct and accessible\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P1\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-002\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-014\",\n      \"title\": \"Add recurring event support\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement recurring event patterns: daily, weekly, monthly, yearly. Support recurrence rules with exceptions and end dates.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"RecurrenceRule enum with patterns\",\n        \"Event expansion for recurring events\",\n        \"Daily, weekly, monthly, yearly recurrence\",\n        \"Recurrence end date option\",\n        \"Recurrence exceptions (skip specific instances)\",\n        \"Recurring events display correctly in all views\",\n        \"Editing recurring events modifies all future instances or single instance\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P1\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-002\",\n        \"US-004\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-015\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement reminders and notifications\",\n      \"description\": \"Add reminder system with time-based alerts. Show in-app notifications when reminders trigger. Support multiple reminder times per event.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Reminder struct with time offset\",\n        \"Event can have multiple reminders\",\n        \"Background timer checks for due reminders\",\n        \"In-app notification popup when reminder triggers\",\n        \"Notification includes event title and time\",\n        \"Mark reminders as dismissed\",\n        \"Reminders persist with events\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P2\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-003\",\n        \"US-014\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-016\",\n      \"title\": \"Add event search with vim-style search\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement search functionality with '/' key to initiate search, 'n' for next result, 'N' for previous result. Support searching by title, description, and category.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"'/' key opens search prompt\",\n        \"Search input with vim-style editing\",\n        \"Search matches title, description, category\",\n        \"'n' navigates to next matching event\",\n        \"'N' navigates to previous matching event\",\n        \"Match count displayed\",\n        \"Escape exits search mode\",\n        \"Highlighted search results in view\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P2\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-003\",\n        \"US-012\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-017\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement event filtering\",\n      \"description\": \"Add filtering options to show/hide events by category. Display active filters and provide quick toggle keys.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Filter panel shows all categories\",\n        \"Toggle visibility of each category\",\n        \"View updates to show only filtered events\",\n        \"Visual indicator of active filters\",\n        \"Quick keys for common filters (f1, f2, etc.)\",\n        \"Clear all filters option\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P2\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-013\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-018\",\n      \"title\": \"Add timezone support\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement timezone handling using chrono-tz. Display times in user's local timezone. Support viewing in different timezones.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Default to system timezone\",\n        \"Display timezone indicator in UI\",\n        \"Option to switch display timezone\",\n        \"Events stored in UTC or with timezone info\",\n        \"Time conversions accurate\",\n        \"Daylight saving time handled\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P2\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-002\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-019\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement iCal import/export\",\n      \"description\": \"Add ability to import events from iCal (.ics) files and export events to iCal format. Support standard iCal RFC 5545.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Import command reads .ics files\",\n        \"Parse iCal VEVENT components\",\n        \"Create events from imported data\",\n        \"Export command writes .ics file\",\n        \"Export includes all events in iCal format\",\n        \"Handle recurring events in iCal\",\n        \"Error handling for malformed files\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P2\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-003\",\n        \"US-014\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-020\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement CSV import/export\",\n      \"description\": \"Add CSV import/export for events. Define CSV format with headers for title, start, end, description, category.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Export writes CSV with all events\",\n        \"CSV has defined header row\",\n        \"Import reads CSV and creates events\",\n        \"Date/time parsing for CSV format\",\n        \"Error handling for invalid rows\",\n        \"Choice to merge or replace on import\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P2\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-003\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-021\",\n      \"title\": \"Add command palette (vim :command style)\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement a command palette triggered by ':' key showing available commands. Support commands like :q to quit, :w to save (if persistence added), :view m for month view, :goto [date], etc.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"':' key opens command palette\",\n        \"Command list shows available commands\",\n        \"Type-ahead filtering of commands\",\n        \"Execute command by selecting and pressing Enter\",\n        \"Common commands: :q, :w, :view, :goto, :search, :filter\",\n        \"Help command shows all available commands\",\n        \"Vim-style command syntax\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P2\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-004\",\n        \"US-011\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-022\",\n      \"title\": \"Add persistent event storage\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement file-based storage for events to persist between sessions. Store events in JSON format in user's config directory.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Events saved to config directory JSON file\",\n        \"Auto-save on event modifications\",\n        \"Load events on startup\",\n        \"Create config directory if not exists\",\n        \"Error handling for read/write failures\",\n        \"Backup option for event data\",\n        \"cargo test && cargo clippy passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": \"P2\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"US-003\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-023\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement configuration file support\",\n      \"description\": \"Add configuration file for user preferences: default view, colors, keybindings, timezone, default category. Use TOML or YAML format.\",\n  